## 1. Smooth Map Tracking (Ola/Uber Style) 🗺️
**File:** `apps/web-app/src/app/globals.css` (Lines 1833-1837)

Markers ko smoothly chalane ke liye Leaflet me default jump animation ko hata kar humne CSS transition lagaya hai:
```css
/* Smooth Marker Animation for WebSocket updates */
.leaflet-marker-icon.bus-marker-icon,
.leaflet-marker-icon.nav-marker-icon {
  transition: transform 1.5s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
}
```
> [!TIP]
> Ab jab bhi WebSocket se naye coordinates ayenge, map marker immediately jump nahi karega, balki **1.5 seconds** ki smooth sliding (gliding) animation dikhayega bilkul Ola/Uber app ki tarah!

