## 2. Smart ETA (Traffic Speed Prediction) 🕒
**File:** `apps/backend/src/engine/eta.ts` (Lines 333, 449)

ETA ki calculation ko accurate banane ke liye `getTrafficSpeedModifier()` function ka fully integration ho chuka hai:
```typescript
// Applying traffic logic to bus speed
const speedFloorKmph = (busSpeed > 25 ? busSpeed : 45) * getTrafficSpeedModifier();

// Calculating the exact ETA minutes based on live adjusted speed
etaMinutes = Math.round((distanceRemainingKm / speedFloorKmph) * 60);
```
> [!IMPORTANT]
> Iska matlab ab system:
> - **Subah (8-11 AM) aur Shaam (5-8 PM)** me ETA time badha dega (kyunki 25% slower traffic expect hoga).
> - **Raat (10 PM - 5 AM)** me ETA time ghata dega (kyunki bus 15% faster chalegi).
> - Ye logic perfectly live data speed ke sath blend ho raha hai!

